"""Step 1 (v3) - Topic-targeted prediction candidates from Impresso (FR/DE/EN).

For each topic (votes, sport, elections) and language, search Impresso for
domain-specific predictive phrases, then filter and score the sentences.

Outputs:
    prediction_candidates_v3.csv   kept candidates
    rejected_candidates.csv        rejected sentences + reason (for tuning)
    cue_stats.csv                  yield of each cue (for tuning)

Usage:
    pip install impresso
    python extract_candidates_v3.py
"""

